## Reactivation note

If a model used here is retired before reactivation, document the
substitution chosen in `LESSONS.md` and supersede the relevant ADRs.
Do not silently re-run the original prompts on a new model — the
output will diverge subtly and you'll spend the next month debugging
phantoms.

